            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"easydot-showcase\">easydot showcase</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Render Graphviz DOT inside browser notebooks without installing Graphviz\nbinaries. <code>easydot</code> ships the WebAssembly renderer, handles notebook\ndisplay integration, and keeps the output small by loading the renderer\nfrom a local asset server or CDN.</span>\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>uv<span class=\"w\"> </span>run<span class=\"w\"> </span>marimo<span class=\"w\"> </span>edit<span class=\"w\"> </span>examples/demo.py\n</code></pre></div></span>"
