            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"8-non-iframe-mode\">8. Non-iframe mode</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Passing <code>iframe=False</code> skips the iframe wrapper. That is useful when\nembedding into a page that already provides layout and executes script\ntags.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Marimo does not execute scripts from plain HTML outputs, so this mode is\nnot rendered in this demo:</span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">easydot</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">display</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">biology_dot</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">iframe</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
